# ─── SECRETS — never commit ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env holds live SEMANTIC_SCHOLAR / GROQ / GEMINI / OPENROUTER keys.
# citation/apikey.env is a SECOND credential file — found only by an explicit
# pre-commit scan, not by the obvious `.env` pattern. Both are excluded by name
# AND by the catch-all patterns below.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.env
**/apikey*
*.key
*secret*
*credential*

# ─── COPYRIGHTED PAPER PDFs — do not redistribute ───────────────────────────
# The corpus is 20 published papers; 10 are paywalled (IEEE/Springer/Elsevier/ACM).
# papers/manifest.csv carries the DOIs and access status so anyone can obtain them
# legitimately. fetch_corpus.sh downloads the open-access subset.
*.pdf
papers/*.pdf
bulk-download/

# ─── Large regenerable artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
# prompts.jsonl regenerates from the parsed HTML; graphml regenerates from triples.json.
output/*/kg/*/*/prompts.jsonl
output/*/kg/*/*/*.graphml
output/**/*.graphml
output/*/no-llm/
output/*/fast/
output/acl/
output/global_kg/
summary/

# ─── Session scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ontology_eval_backup_*/
verdict_backup_*/
before_filter.json
ceo_before.json
*.log
chat_upload/
judge_upload/

# ─── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# stray archives
*.zip

# stale session backups
output_backup_*/
triples_open/
